## 4. Referee Impact Data

**Source**: [NBAstuffer 2025-2026 Referee Stats](https://www.nbastuffer.com/2025-2026-nba-referee-stats/)

**Available Data**:
- Game-by-game referee assignments
- Fouls per game by referee
- Over/Under trends by referee
- ATS (Against The Spread) performance
- Home/Road bias

**Multi-Source Validation Strategy**:

| Source | Data Type | Update Frequency | Purpose |
|--------|-----------|------------------|---------|
| **NBAstuffer** | Daily stats, L5 games | Daily (5 AM) | Recency & volatility |
| **Basketball-Reference** | Career averages, bias | Weekly (Mondays) | Stable baseline personality |
| **Covers.com** | O/U profitability | Weekly | Market efficiency check |
| **OddsShark** | Trend verification | Weekly | Consensus validation |
| **Official NBA** | Assignments | Daily (9 AM ET) | Official crew info |

**Referee Personality Profiles**:
- **High Pace Refs** (e.g., 1.04x multiplier) - More possessions, higher totals
- **Whistle Heavy** (e.g., 1.15x FTA) - More free throws
- **Road Bias** - Calls +2.1 more fouls on road teams
- **Clutch Chaos** - Low L2M (Last 2 Minute) correct call % → widen variance

**Application to S.A.V.A.G.E.**:
- Module G (Zebras) fetches assignments at 9:05 AM
- Apply pace multiplier to base 99.5 possessions
- Adjust FTA projections for whistle-heavy refs
- Flag "trap games" when Stuffer says "High Fouls" but Covers shows "Under Trend"

